  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>천재교과서(정대홍) 180페이지 활동을 기반으로 제작하였습니다.</p><p>2022개정 교육과정에서 센서를 활용하는 실험이 많아지면서 이를 어떻게 학생들에게 이해시킬지 고민을 많이 하였습니다.</p><p>그래서 이해를 돕기 위해 웹앱과 학습지를 제작하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>많은 학교에 아직 센서가 없을텐데, 저처럼 센서없이 수업을 진행해야하는 학교에 도움이 되길 바랄게요!!</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/454c9aff394c01257ee91e20663752c3bbfeef60?download\" data-file-name=\"광합성_물질과산물_학습지_교사용.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2669254\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1451%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20261001112749&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F454c9aff394c01257ee91e20663752c3bbfeef60')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">광합성_물질과산물_학습지_교사용</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.55MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/40a51c916ba625b7498879dc69c27e98081a007b?download\" data-file-name=\"광합성_물질과산물_학습지_학생용.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2266536\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1451%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20261001112749&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F40a51c916ba625b7498879dc69c27e98081a007b')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">광합성_물질과산물_학습지_학생용</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.16MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0e618452b324713dd0dfbfa0ff143a0175a77e2c?download\" data-file-name=\"광합성_물질과산물_수업웹앱.html\" data-file-size=\"81109\" data-mimetype=\"text/html\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus(